IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. PAYMENT.
DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 TEXT-VALUE PIC XX VALUE 'AB'.
01 COUNT-VALUE PIC 99 VALUE 0.
01 BALANCE PIC 9(5)V99.
01 FEE PIC 9(5)V99.
01 RESPONSE-CODE PIC XX.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 ACCEPT BALANCE
 INSPECT TEXT-VALUE TALLYING COUNT-VALUE FOR ALL 'A'
 IF COUNT-VALUE = 1
 COMPUTE FEE ROUNDED = BALANCE * 0.015
 ELSE MOVE 0 TO FEE END-IF
 CALL 'SYNTHETIC' USING BY REFERENCE RESPONSE-CODE
 IF RESPONSE-CODE = 'OK' DISPLAY 'OK' ELSE DISPLAY 'ERROR' END-IF
 DISPLAY FEE
 GOBACK.
